.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QA86ynvZjqIQ7kNvwFSmfjN&_nc_oc=AdqzBqqdoLs3AheK3gBK-7LoMzlTdkKsHUgk7WSGjNun4iaZmCbDiy93mB-3g1eu5sM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRuC4uzZvUvwx-Zrxj9BAcrXtUYWjMB0LRCL8eSgdOa6Q&oe=6AFB47E2"}, "display_name": "The Deep: Beyond the Reef", "keywords": ["underwater", "exploration", "adventure"], "long_description": "**Dive into The Deep**, an underwater adventure game based on the acclaimed graphic novel series and award-winning Netflix show. Featuring the original voice cast in an all-new adventure, you play as Ant, youngest member of the Nekton family of explorers. \n\n- Strap into the Vulcan Knight, a prototype aquatic mech \n{1242079381297479}\n- Explore ancient civilizations \n{1981481742613961}\n- Avoid lethal threats \n{681988514933906}\n- Collect artifacts\n{1532313101129389}\n- And stop a lethal contamination that threatens to spread across the entire ocean.\n{1087659246525233}\n{2745496312319488}", "short_description": "Dive into The Deep, an underwater adventure game based on the acclaimed graphic novel series and award-winning Netflix show. Featuring the original voice cast in an all-new adventure, you play as Ant, youngest member of the Nekton family of explorers. Strap into the Vulcan Knight, a prototype aquatic mech, to explore ancient civilizations, avoid lethal threats, collect artifacts, and stop a lethal contamination that threatens to spread across the entire ocean."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.darkslope.com/legal/ms3000", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dark Slope Studios Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://darkslope.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}